    "source_review": "All 11 methods use original actual APIs; fixed records are selected by unique public identity. Crossing controls match the original bear DEF200/MR50 and round DEF0/MR50 separately. Tests preserve already-light components, signed -2/-1 report metadata, selected identity precedence over stale manual bool/string/range, original invalid-manual/training/type guards, duplicate-inventory de-duplication, no-target pending eligibility, caller/value snapshots, empty targets/windows and locked talent. Formatting keeps original keyword-only technical=True usage; format_estimate delegates to format_report on report-bearing results. Preview explicitly excludes relics. Mechanical controls use window30 and assert positive plain total rather than relying on the old zero-hit window3. This is a proposed real assertion contract, not an executed PASS.",
